:: Tailor Shop
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>

당신은 양복점에 있다. 다양한 색상의 천이 옷걸이에 걸려 있다.
<br><br>

<<if $sewingKit isnot 1 and $DoLPSpools isnot undefined>>
	가게 진열장에 새로운 재봉틀이 판매용으로 나온 것 같다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $sewingBought is 1>>
	"구매해 주셔서 감사합니다. 돌아가실 때까지 방으로 배달해 드리겠습니다."
	<br><br>
	<<set $sewingBought to 0>>
<</if>>

<<set $tailor_cost to 0>>
<<set $outfitRepair to []>>
<<set _time to 0>>
<<set _outfitTime to 0>>
<<set _brokenOutfit to 0>>

<<for _active_clothes range Object.keys($worn)>>
	<<if setup.clothes[_active_clothes] is undefined or _active_clothes is "genitals">>
		<<continue>>
	<</if>>

	<<if _active_clothes is "lower" or _active_clothes is "under_lower">>
		<<if $worn[_active_clothes].one_piece is 1>>
			<<if $worn[_active_clothes].integrity lt clothingData(_active_clothes,$worn[_active_clothes],'integrity_max')>>
				<<set _outfitTime += 5>>
			<</if>>
			<<continue>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $worn[_active_clothes].integrity lt clothingData(_active_clothes,$worn[_active_clothes],'integrity_max') and $worn[_active_clothes].integrity gt 0 and clothingData(_active_clothes,$worn[_active_clothes],'integrity_max') gt 0>>
		<<set $tailor_cost += Math.trunc(tailorClothingCost($worn[_active_clothes],_active_clothes) * (1 - $worn[_active_clothes].integrity / clothingData(_active_clothes,$worn[_active_clothes],'integrity_max')))>>
		<<set _time += 5>>
	<</if>>

	<<if _brokenOutfit is 0>>
		<<set _brokenOutfit to getOutfitPair()>>
		<<if _brokenOutfit.length is 0>>
			<<set _brokenOutfit to 1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</for>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop "shop">>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.hour is 21>>
		폐점 시간이다. 경비원이 모든 사람을 밖으로 몰아내고 있다. <<if $exposed gte 1>>경비원이 이 옷차림을 본다면 얼마나 노출되어 있을지 깨닫고 공황 상태에 빠진다.<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<if $exposed lte 0>>
			<<highicon>><<link [[밖으로 나간다|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<ind>><<link [["끝날 때까지 숨는다 (1:00)"|Tailor Shop]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
			어둠 속에 당신 혼자 있다.
			<br><br>

			<<if Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.tailor>>
				<<shopicon "register">><<link [[금전 등록기를 살펴본다|Tailor Register]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>

			당신은 존엄성을 지키기 위해 천 더미 뒤에 숨어 있다.
			<br><br>

			<<if _brokenOutfit isnot 0 && _brokenOutfit isnot 1>>
				<<generate1>><<person1>>카운터 뒤에서 일하는 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 발견하고는 도와줄 수 있다고 말한다.

				<<for _i = 0; _i lt _brokenOutfit.length; _i++>>
					<<set _brokenOutfitTime to 15>><<set _tailorCostMod to .55>>
					<<set _tailorCostMod += .43 * (1 - $worn[_brokenOutfit[_i].wornHalf].integrity / clothingData(_brokenOutfit[_i].wornHalf,$worn[_brokenOutfit[_i].wornHalf],'integrity_max'))>>

					<<if _brokenOutfit[_i].brokenHalf.includes("under")>>
						<<set _brokenOutfitTime += 5>><<set _tailorCostMod += .06>>
						<<He>> tells you that your <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> will take a little more time and effort if you're willing to take the risk. The repair will cost <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>.
					<<else>>
						<<He>> can repair your missing <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>.
					<</if>>
					<br>

					<<set _tempText to `수선하기 ` + _brokenOutfit[_i].name + ` (0:` + (_brokenOutfitTime lt 10 ? "0":"") + _brokenOutfitTime + `)`>>

					<<capture _i>>
						<<link [[_tempText|Fix Outfit]]>> <<set $outfitRepair to _brokenOutfit[_i]>><<pass _brokenOutfitTime>><<money `-Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)` "tailor">> <</link>>
					<</capture>>
					<br><br>
				<</for>>

				<<unset _tempText>>
			<</if>>

		<<else>>
			<<generate1>><<person1>>"어서 오세요." 재단사가 말한다. "오늘은 어떤 서비스가 필요하신가요?
			저희는 옷 수선 서비스를 제공합니다. 매주 배달을 통한 수선 서비스도 제공하고 있습니다."
			<br><br>
			<<if $tailor_cost gte 1 and $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.spendPrice($tailor_cost, "tailor") : $tailor_cost)>>
				<<He>> offers to fix what you're currently wearing for <<printprice `Math.trunc($tailor_cost)`>>.
				<br>
				<<shopicon "tailor">><<print '<<link [[옷 수선하기 (0:'+(_time lt 10 ? "0":"")+_time+')|Fix Clothes]]>><<money '+ -$tailor_cost + ' "tailor">><<pass _time>><</link>>'>>
				<br><br>
				<<set _options to true>>
			<<elseif $money lt (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.spendPrice($tailor_cost, "tailor") : $tailor_cost)>>
				You don't have enough cash to repair your current clothes. (<<printprice `Math.trunc($tailor_cost)` "red">>)
				<br><br>
				<<set _options to true>>
			<</if>>

			<<if ($worn.upper.set is $worn.lower.set and $worn.lower.integrity lt clothingData('lower',$worn.lower,'integrity_max')) or ($worn.under_upper.set is $worn.under_lower.set and $worn.under_lower.integrity lt clothingData('under_lower',$worn.under_lower,'integrity_max'))>>
				재단사가 옷의 하의 부분을 무료로 수선해 줄 것이다.
				<br>
				<<shopicon "tailor">><<print '<<link [[옷을 수선한다 (0:'+(_outfitTime lt 10 ? "0":"")+_outfitTime+')|Fix Lower]]>><<pass _outfitTime>><</link>>'>>
				<br><br>
				<<set _options to true>>
			<</if>>

			<<if _brokenOutfit isnot 0 && _brokenOutfit isnot 1>>

				<<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<print _brokenOutfit[random(0,_brokenOutfit.length -1)].name>>【이가】 망가진 것을 알아차린다.
				"시간은 좀 걸리겠지만, 다른 반쪽에 맞춰서 온전하게 만들어 줄 수 있어요." <<He>>【은는】 당신의 반응을 살피기 위해 잠시 멈춘다. "관심 있나요?"
				<br><br>

				<<set _secondUnderItem to false>><<set _secondOverItem to false>>

				<<for _i = 0; _i lt _brokenOutfit.length; _i++>>
					<<set _brokenOutfitTime to 15>><<set _tailorCostMod to .55>>
					<<set _outfitSlot to _brokenOutfit[_i].wornHalf>>
					<<set _integrityMax to Math.clamp(clothingData(_outfitSlot, $worn[_outfitSlot], 'integrity_max'), 1, 100_000)>>
					<<set _tailorCostMod += Math.max(.43 * (1 - $worn[_outfitSlot].integrity / _integrityMax), 0)>>

					<<if _brokenOutfit[_i].brokenHalf.includes("under")>>
						<<set _brokenOutfitTime += 5>><<set _tailorCostMod += .06>>

						<<if _secondUnderItem isnot true>>
							<<set _secondUnderItem to true>>
							"아, <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> 같은 건 다른 옷보다 고치는 데 시간과 노력이 조금 더 듭니다." <<He>>【은는】 말을 멈추고 작업에 필요한 특수 원단을 보여준다.
							"If you're fine with that, I can replace it for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>."
						<<else>>
							<<He>> can fix your <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>.
						<</if>>

					<<elseif _brokenOutfit[_i].brokenHalf.includes("over")>>
						<<set _brokenOutfitTime -= 5>><<set _tailorCostMod -= .08>>

						<<if _secondOverItem isnot true>>
							<<set _secondOverItem to true>>
							"제 실력이라면 <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> 수선쯤은 아주 간단합니다." <<He>>【은는】 증거로 가게 안의 좀 더 복잡한 옷들을 가리킨다.
							"This repair is relatively easy, so I can do it for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit.over.outfitCost * _tailorCostMod)`>>. Deal?"
						<<else>>
							The ease of the repair means <<he>> can patch up your <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>.
						<</if>>

					<<else>>
						<<He>> offers to replace your missing <<print _brokenOutfit[_i].name>> for <<printprice `Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)`>>.
					<</if>>
					<br>

					<<set _tempText to `수선하기 ` + _brokenOutfit[_i].name + ` (0:` + (_brokenOutfitTime lt 10 ? "0":"") + _brokenOutfitTime + `)`>>
					<<capture _i>>
						<<link [[_tempText|Fix Outfit]]>> <<set $outfitRepair to _brokenOutfit[_i]>><<pass _brokenOutfitTime>><<money `-Math.trunc(_brokenOutfit[_i].cost * _tailorCostMod)` "tailor">> <</link>>
					<</capture>>
					<br><br>
				<</for>>

				<<unset _tempText>><<unset _secondUnderItem>><<unset _secondOverItem>>
				<<set _options to true>>
			<</if>>

			<<if _options isnot true>>
				당신이 현재 입고 있는 옷은 이미 완전히 수선되었다.
				<br><br>
			<</if>>

			<<if $DoLPSpools is undefined>>
				"배워 보고 싶으시다면요." <<he>>【이가】 말을 잇는다. "재봉 키트와 실패도 팔아요."
				<br>
				<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(10000) : 10000)>>
					<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy a sewing kit (<<printprice 10000>>)|$passage]]>>
						<<money -10000 "tailorSupplies">>
						<<set $DoLPSpools to 0>>
					<</link>>
				<<else>>
					You can't afford the sewing kit. (<<printprice `Math.trunc(10000)` "red">>)
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
			<<else>>
				"실패는 꼭 채워 두세요." <<he>>【이가】 말을 잇는다. "재봉 키트는 실패가 없으면 별 쓸모가 없거든요." 당신은 실패를 <span class="green">$DoLPSpools</span>개 가지고 있다.
				<br>
				<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(500) : 500)>>
					<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy 5 spools (<<printprice 500>>)|$passage]]>>
						<<money -500 "tailorSupplies">>
						<<set $DoLPSpools += 5>>
							<<endevent>>
					<</link>>
					<br>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(1000) : 1000)>>
						<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy 10 spools (<<printprice 1000>>)|$passage]]>>
							<<money -1000 "tailorSupplies">>
							<<set $DoLPSpools += 10>>
							<<endevent>>
						<</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(2500) : 2500)>>
						<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy 25 spools (<<printprice 2500>>)|$passage]]>>
							<<money -2500 "tailorSupplies">>
							<<set $DoLPSpools += 25>>
							<<endevent>>
						<</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(5000) : 5000)>>
						<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy 50 spools (<<printprice 5000>>)|$passage]]>>
							<<money -5000 "tailorSupplies">>
							<<set $DoLPSpools += 50>>
							<<endevent>>
						<</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(10000) : 10000)>>
						<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Buy 100 spools (<<printprice 10000>>)|$passage]]>>
							<<money -10000 "tailorSupplies">>
							<<set $DoLPSpools += 100>>
							<<endevent>>
						<</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					You can't afford the spools. (<<printprice `Math.trunc(500)` "red">>)
					<br><br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>

			<<if $wardrobeRepair isnot undefined>>
				수선된 옷을 찾으러 옷장에 가야 한다.
			<<elseif $tailorMonthlyService is undefined>>
				재단사는 당신이 <<him>> 옆에 있는 작은 나무 상자를 쳐다보는 것을 눈치챈다. "아, 마침 매주 배달 서비스가 필요하시다면 운이 좋으시네요. 지역 내라면 무료로 배달해 드립니다."
				<br>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask how much they offer for old clothes|Tailor Monthly Discard]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[모든 옷을 수선하는 데 얼마인지 묻는다|Tailor Monthly Repair]]>><</link>>
			<<elseif $tailorMonthlyService is "repair">>
				/* TODO: Rename these variables to tailorWeeklyService and change in version update code. Also rename "monthly" passages to "weekly" and move players to the new passages through Config.navigation.override */
				수선할 옷을 담을 상자가 기다리고 있다.
			<<elseif $tailorMonthlyService is "discard">>
				팔 옷을 담을 상자가 기다리고 있다.
			<<elseif $tailorMonthlyService gt 0>>
				당신은 최근에 이 서비스를 이용했으며, 다시 이용하려면 $tailorMonthlyService일 동안 기다려야 한다.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<if getAvailableWardrobeHomes().length gt 1>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask the tailor about moving your clothes|Tailor Wardrobe Moving]]>><</link>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>

			<<if $sewingKit isnot 1 and $DoLPSpools isnot undefined>>
				<<ind>><<link [[진열장으로 다가간다|Tailor Shop Sewing Machine]]>><</link>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<endevent>><<unset $outfitRepair>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Fix Clothes

당신의 옷이 수선되었다.
<br><br>
<<set _equip to setup.clothingLayer.all>>
<<for _i to 0; _i lt _equip.length; _i++>>
	<<set $worn[_equip[_i]].integrity = clothingData(_equip[_i],$worn[_equip[_i]],'integrity_max')>>
<</for>>

<<link [[돌아가기|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Fix Lower

당신의 하의가 수선되었다.
<br><br>
<<if $worn.upper.set is $worn.lower.set>>
	<<set $worn.lower.integrity = getSetupClothing('lower', $worn.lower)?.integrity_max>>
<</if>>

<<if $worn.under_upper.set is $worn.under_lower.set>>
	<<set $worn.under_lower.integrity = getSetupClothing('under_lower', $worn.under_lower)?.integrity_max>>
<</if>>

<<link [[돌아가기|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Shop Sneak
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<set $lock to 0>>

<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<span class="blue">팔이 묶여 있지만 않다면</span> 자물쇠를 딸 수 있을 것 같다.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "lockpick">>
		<span class="green">자물쇠는 쉽게 딸 수 있을 것 같다.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[자물쇠를 딴다 (0:10)|Tailor Shop]]>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 10 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">자물쇠는 당신의 능력 밖인 것 같다.</span>
	<<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Shop Sewing Machine
<<effects>>
진열장으로 다가가자 재봉틀이 놓여 있다. 진열장 옆에 광고 포스터가 걸려 있고, 이렇게 적혀 있다.

	<br><br>
	재봉의 신-9000 <sup>tm</sup>
	<br><br>
	- 개가 속옷을 물어뜯었나요? <span class="pink">~촉수~</span>가 옷을 찢었나요? 문제없습니다!
	<br><br>
	- 1분 만에 어떤 옷이든 고칠 수 있습니다!
	<br><br>
	- <span class="green">기술</span>이 필요 없습니다! 베일리조차도 사용할 수 있습니다!
	<br><br>
	- 평생 쓸 수 있는 수선용 천을 제공합니다!
	<br><br>
	- Only <span class ="gold"><<printprice 100000>>!</span>
	<br><br>

	<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(100000) : 100000)>>
		<<link [[Purchase sewing machine - Repair your clothes in your room! <<printprice 100000>>|Tailor Shop]]>><<money -100000 "tailor">><<set $sewingKit to 1>><<set $sewingBought to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[돌아가기|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Monthly Discard
"Certainly, <<pMs>>. We'll have the crate delivered. Fill it as soon as you're ready to sell them. Please bear in mind that we are not allowed to return any items. We will also only take items we can repair and resell."
<br><br>

<<set _value to 0>>
<<for _label, _items range $wardrobe>>
	<<for _i to 0; _i lt _items.length; _i++>>
		<<if setup.clothes[_label][clothesIndex(_label,_items[_i])].shop.length is 0>>
			<<continue>>
		<</if>>
		<<if !setup.clothingLayer.all.includes(_label)>>
			<<continue>>
		<</if>>
		<<set _value += Math.floor(tailorClothingCost(_items[_i], _label) * 0.2)>>
	<</for>>
<</for>>
You think it will earn you <<printmoney _value>>.

<br><br>
<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[Confirm the sale|Tailor Monthly Driver]]>>
	<<set $tailorMonthlyService to "discard">>
<</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[판매를 물린다|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Monthly Repair
"Certainly, <<pMs>>. We'll have the crate delivered. Fill it as soon as you're ready for repairs. Please bear in mind that it will take <span class="gold">a day</span> before we get them back to you.
옷을 저희에게 보낸 뒤에 너무 많은 새 옷을 사지 않도록 주의해 주세요. 그렇지 않으면 배달 기사가 기부금으로 가져가야 할 테니까요."
<br><br>

<<set _value to 0>>
<<for _label, _items range $wardrobe>>
	<<for _i to 0; _i lt _items.length; _i++>>
		<<set _value += Math.floor(tailorClothingCost(_items[_i],_label) * (1 - (_items[_i].integrity / clothingData(_label,_items[_i],'integrity_max'))) * 1.25,_label)>>
	<</for>>
<</for>>
비용은
<<if _value gt 5000>>
	<<printmoney `_value - 5000`>>
<<else>>
	무료
<</if>>
일 것 같다. 보증금으로 비용이 줄었기 때문이다.

<br><br>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(5000, "tailorDeposit")>>
	<<shopicon "tailor">><<link [[수선을 확정하고 보증금 £50를 낸다|Tailor Monthly Driver]]>>
		<<money -5000 "tailorDeposit">>
		<<set $tailorMonthlyService to "repair">>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	보증금을 낼 돈이 부족하다.
<</if>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[수선을 물린다|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Monthly Driver
재단사가 상자를 집어 들고 가게 안쪽으로 들어간다.
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Tailor Wardrobe Moving
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>
<div id="wardrobe-moving-service">
	<<if !$settings.multipleWardrobes>>
		The tailor explains that there is no need for the service while all your wardrobes share the same storage.
	<<else>>
		<<set _homeLocations to getAvailableWardrobeHomes()>>
		<<if _homeLocations.length lt 2>>
			The tailor has nowhere else to send your clothes yet.
		<<else>>
			"We can collect all the clothes stored at your other homes and deliver them straight to one wardrobe," the tailor says. "It'll cost <<printprice 1000>>. Where are you moving to?"
			<br><br>
			<<set _targetWardrobe to _homeLocations[0]>>
			<<set _locationMap to {}>>
			<<run _homeLocations.forEach(location => _locationMap[$wardrobes[location].name] = location)>>
			Destination:
			<<listbox "_targetWardrobe" autoselect>>
				<<optionsfrom _locationMap>>
			<</listbox>>
			<br><br>
			<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(1000, "tailor")>>
				<<set _moveCostText to formatMoney(setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(1000) : 1000)>>
				<<set _moveLinkText to "Arrange the move (" + _moveCostText + ")">>
				<<link _moveLinkText>>
					<<set _homeLocations to getAvailableWardrobeHomes()>>
					<<set _sourceLocations to getAvailableWardrobeHomes(true)>>
					<<set _targetWardrobeObj to _targetWardrobe is "wardrobe" ? $wardrobe : $wardrobes[_targetWardrobe]>>
					<<set _targetSpace to Number.isFinite(_targetWardrobeObj?.space) ? _targetWardrobeObj.space : 0>>
					<<set _canMove to _homeLocations.includes(_targetWardrobe) and _targetSpace gt 0>>
					<<set _movingCount to 0>>
					<<for _slot range setup.clothes_all_slots>>
						<<set _slotTotal to Array.isArray(_targetWardrobeObj?.[_slot]) ? _targetWardrobeObj[_slot].length : 0>>
						<<for _source range _sourceLocations>>
							<<if _source is _targetWardrobe>><<continue>><</if>>
							<<set _sourceWardrobeObj to _source is "wardrobe" ? $wardrobe : $wardrobes[_source]>>
							<<if Array.isArray(_sourceWardrobeObj?.[_slot])>>
								<<set _slotTotal += _sourceWardrobeObj[_slot].length>>
								<<set _movingCount += _sourceWardrobeObj[_slot].length>>
							<</if>>
						<</for>>
						<<if _slotTotal gt _targetSpace>><<set _canMove to false>><</if>>
					<</for>>

					<<if getWardrobeItemCount(_targetWardrobeObj, true) + _movingCount gt 3000>><<set _canMove to false>><</if>>
					<<if !_canMove>>
						<<replace "#wardrobe-moving-service">><span class="red">The tailor checks the details and tells you that wardrobe does not have enough room for all your clothes. You are not charged.</span><</replace>>
					<<elseif _movingCount is 0>>
						<<replace "#wardrobe-moving-service">>The tailor checks the addresses, but you have no clothes stored elsewhere to move. You are not charged.<</replace>>
					<<elseif !setup.inflation.canAfford(1000, "tailor")>>
						<<replace "#wardrobe-moving-service">><span class="red">You no longer have enough cash for the moving service. You are not charged.</span><</replace>>
					<<else>>
						<<money -1000 "tailor">>
						<<for _source range _sourceLocations>>
							<<if _source is _targetWardrobe>><<continue>><</if>>
							<<set _sourceWardrobeObj to _source is "wardrobe" ? $wardrobe : $wardrobes[_source]>>
							<<for _slot range setup.clothes_all_slots>>
								<<if Array.isArray(_sourceWardrobeObj?.[_slot])>>
									<<for _i = _sourceWardrobeObj[_slot].length; _i gt 0; _i-->>
										<<run transferClothing(_slot, 0, _source, _targetWardrobe, { moveLinkedPieces: false })>>
									<</for>>
								<</if>>
							<</for>>
						<</for>>
						<<replace "#wardrobe-moving-service">>The tailor makes a quick call. Your clothes are collected and delivered to the <<print $wardrobes[_targetWardrobe].name>> immediately.<</replace>>
					<</if>>
				<</link>>
			<<else>>
				<span class="red">You don't have enough cash for the moving service. (<<printprice 1000>>)</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
</div>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Back|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Fix Outfit
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	재단사가 필요한 수선을 하는 동안 당신은 계속 숨어 있는다. 영원할 것 같은 시간이 지난 후, <<he>>【이가】 당신의 <<print $outfitRepair.name>>【을를】 돌려주고 당신은 옷을 입는다.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	가게를 서성거리자 재단사가 몇 가지 사소한 조정을 위해 당신을 부른다.
	그러자 당신의 <<print $outfitRepair.name>>【은는】 새것처럼 깨끗해진다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<set $worn[$outfitRepair.wornHalf].integrity = clothingData($outfitRepair.wornHalf,$worn[$outfitRepair.wornHalf],'integrity_max')>>
<<set makeMissingOutfit($outfitRepair)>>
<<unset $outfitRepair>>

<<link [[돌아가기|Tailor Shop]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
